  "notes": [
    "The verifier proxy has routed to the same implementation since its creation in the 2021 deployment transaction; no upgrade or configuration change touched the exit path before the exploit. The operator's February 2025 block commits are normal operation.",
    "Campaign: every later transaction that called verifyExitProof (attacker 0x0a652dec, second actor 0x23746176, and 0x383b0191 in May 2026) and every withdrawal realising those exits. The attacker's earlier LP-token mint and deposits only set up Exodus Mode and moved no bridge assets.",
    "Fabricated tokens the actors deposited and withdrew net to zero and are excluded. gZKS, ZKS, WQTUM and HBTC have no price series and no traceable sale, so they carry quantity at 0 USD and the total is a lower bound."
  ],
